!byehoo_logo.jpg

# --- Local Email Archive Files ---
*.eml
*.msg
yahoo_archive/
emls/
attachments/

# --- Local Databases (SQL Server / SQLite) ---
*.mdf
*.ldf
*.bak
*.db
*.sqlite

# --- User-Specific Notes (Requested) ---
# Excludes all your personal documentation and notes
*.doc
*.docx
*.pdf
# Also common for notes
*.txt
# Except requirements & license files
!requirements.txt
!LICENSE.txt

# --- OS Specific ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

